.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-config 1  "config " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-config \- Print the effective (merged, resolved) config as TOML
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc config\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the effective (merged, resolved) config as TOML
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
